<!-- MyBudget's mark: an open envelope with banknotes in it and a coin in front (envelope budgeting: money set aside for a
     purpose), on the indigo tile. No currency sign: budgets can be in any currency. Used for the launcher icon (inset in
     ic_launcher_foreground), the app header and the widget. -->
